<title>GEORGIA: SOCCER-ENGLAND BEAT GEORGIA 2-0.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLAND BEAT GEORGIA 2-0.</headline>
<dateline>TBILISI 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>England beat Georgia 2-0 (halftime 2-0) in a World Cup European group two qualifying match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Teddy Sheringham 15, Les Ferdinand 37</p>
<p>Attendance: 75,000  </p>
<p>Group two standings (tabulated - played, won, drawn, lost,</p>
<p>goals for, goals against, points):</p>
<p> England		3   3   0   0   7   1   9</p>
<p> Italy		  2   2   0   0   4   1   6</p>
<p> Poland		 1   0   0   1   1   2   0</p>
<p> Georgia		2   0   0   2   0   3   0</p>
<p> Moldova		2   0   0   2   1   6   0</p>
<p>Next match: November 10, Poland v Moldova.</p>
</text>
